Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, is waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride\Naway, we're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun,\Nwhile our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake\Nup, heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld. Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.56,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds will never give up. There's\Na fire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop\Nit We will be one, go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in the old days,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,way before your time Garp was\Nconsidered the devil incarnate to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,all pirates They say time heals\Nall wounds But decades have passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and my pain still remains. Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is all that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear him right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is definitely Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you answer\Nwhen he called you Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as you're Garp's grandson, I'm afraid\Nyou're gonna have to pay for his sins!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it up with Grandpa, why don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, so you two are related!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I call everyone Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly are the\Nnotorious Straw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut you down where you stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what the real shame is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I'd found out about\NGarp's son, Dragon, sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have prevented you from\Nbeing born in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems Don Jinjiao's starting to brawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's slow down and talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rip that ridiculous beard off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It took me years to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Don is getting back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he going to attack again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much old age has affected\Nhim, but in his prime, the bounty on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,ran over a half a billion berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way, Don Xin Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't, I'm\Nafraid things will get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cavendish is drawing his sword on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the finest blades\Nin the world, Durandal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry this, head, arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful sword, blue bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cavendish is gonna cut\Nthrough his skull! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're equally matched!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolando can't stab him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That big guy's head is\Ntougher than a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the other guy's holding\Nhim off with one arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's not going to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I fight back at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost as old as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just KO? Qin Zhao?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that little bearded guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a walloping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It had no effect?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe all the legends about\Nhim are actually true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They say with one headbutt, Qin Zhao\Nsplit the ice continent in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole stinking continent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't holding back on that punch,\NBut the old man got right back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't this a nice surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You two have talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But sadly, it won't be enough\Nto save you from my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one thing I know for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on your strength, your Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the grandson of a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You steal popularity from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All you seem to do is attract iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:06:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of those things is my fault. You\Ngot it, and my name's Lucy, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,if you had as much brains as looks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd stay out of my way,\NCavendish or I'll kill you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your damn mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get us disqualified—it's\NZoro from the Kaidou kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,unhand your grandfather this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever's going on, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I found Garp's grandson, my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember why we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're eliminated, we can't\Nfulfill our real purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys over there had better not\Nbe doing what I think you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Any fighting outside the\Narena results in ejection!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Those
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are Coliseum guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna settle the score right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,now Elimination be damned!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That fake bearded guy's in Block C.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see him again in the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want to kill him,\Njust wait until the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let\Nyou escape, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be dead before you\Nset foot in that arena!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the mess they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that all about anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard someone say Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought or you're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They could have been talking\Nabout the pirate Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he entered?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to lay low too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes my promise to Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only about 70\Ncompetitors still left in the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The military captain of Dressrosa's\Nself-defense army has been eliminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another victim of the sinister\Npair, Abdullah and Jeet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be disqualified\Nfor dirty tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The tank can't be out yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, over a hundred\Ngladiators have fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There are barely thirty\Nleft standing in the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much longer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how tough the remaining\Ncompetition is, we have the King Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you wants to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For those of you who wish\Nto bleed, step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Abdullah and Jeet, that vicious duo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,have mercilessly taken\Ndown the strongman, Lepant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a bleed, Delvin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So cruel, so vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look these words up in the dictionary and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll surely find a\Npicture of this man's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other side of the stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,a duel has erupted between\NJiao Kung Do martial
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,artist Blue Gilly and\Nthe mysterious gladiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricky, which of these bruisers\Nwill emerge victorious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been watching how\Ntough that fish dude is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked out all his\Nopponents in a single blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I hope he wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there no depth to which\NBartolomeo will sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How low will he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't anybody kicking his ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In plain view of this arena,\Nwithout any discretion,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he's pulled out his unspeakable bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and is relieving himself in the mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The most indecent act ever performed\Nin the history of this coliseum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's desecrating a place of bloodshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too proud to strike you from\Nbehind if you won't take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You better finish with that quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You degenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the fence is here with my wiener out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The hero that has answered our\Nplea is the fishman warrior, Hack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Four thousand brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick this guy's ass, Hack! Fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Hack the one on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle-O-Mail didn't flinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who or what is this lewd, crude contender?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely some kind of monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hack is defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked like he didn't\Neven get near him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Bartolomeo do just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no, I was rooting for Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone put an end to that\Nobnoxious little jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to be impartial?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's anybody's\Ngame at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,B-blocks down to 24 competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,About time to wrap this thing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy will be fun to kill. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heating up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Comes the moment we planned for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the most accomplished\Nfighters are dropping
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,like flies—not just Hack\Nbut the unknown gladiator!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricky is down for the count as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Ghillie is on a roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,roll
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think you could cut\Nanything with a doflate like that, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, my old age was what bested me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate his cheering for bloodshed,\Nbut even more so, I hate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogama had the right idea, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This competition is really thinning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the other guys are long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we teamed up, or I would be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for the cue from Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it's time to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll fight amongst\Nourselves until somebody wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a few guys left standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eliminate Blue Gilly while\Nwe're all still working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogma? Gamma?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a pack of dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Loyal, but not too bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to give a signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You lied!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,TRAINOR!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just following orders, same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you were in on this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You were gonna use and get\Nrid of us from the very start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're too greedy for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you live long\Nenough to collect your pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Warriors who can't think for themselves\Nend up doing someone else's dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you take care\Nof the rest, Longleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've made a fatal mistake at\Nturning your back to me, Bluekilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you betray me, Blueno!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dagobah, the tactician, is defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy couldn't have\Nbeen any more suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised anyone here\Nwas willing to trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy's down, but he's the\None who went in for the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How does Bartolomeo keep doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, folks, I think Bellamy's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of\NDevil Fruit did you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They beat him without even moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like what he did to Haki earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep banging in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Isabella, what do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what good's a king without\Nany loyal subjects to rule over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, everyone in this arena\Nwants to be the one to do you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dagoma served his purpose well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My punch is warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to throw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is more dangerous\Nthan an unchecked weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That formation wasn't\Nprotecting me from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was protecting you from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I just thought of\Nsomething. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the King of Pirates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard about that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They said he destroyed an entire\Nenemy fort with a single punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he had a cannon\Nor something. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that punch is powerful\Nenough to defeat one of the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My point is, if that story's legit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,then everybody on this side of the\NColiseum's gonna be blown away by the impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, nobody can punch that hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember hearing that story, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he throws a punch like that,\Nhundreds of people will die for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The tension is palpable. Now after quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,keeping that punch in\Nreserve it looks like the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,king's ready to strike
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,mark
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my words
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,i will win
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.75,0:17:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the flame flame fruit for\Nthe kingdom of produce
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,this does not look good he's gonna do\Nit here he comes we should run hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the rumors were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, not giving up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your stupid spring off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to find out you\Nmessed with the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance to kill him! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in the ring could\Nhave survived that blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Elisabello has wiped out all of his\Ncompetition with a single punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to be on the\Nwrong side of that punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There you have it, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, Blue Gilly, and all the\Nother fighters have been eliminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of all 138 competitors in Block B,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby proclaim the\Nvictor to be King Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is somebody still down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the fight's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing he was facing\Nthat side when he punched.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all safe over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.04,0:19:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a barrier what's\Nwrong can't create a wall
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,by crossing your fingers\Nlike this come on it's so
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,easy a little kid could\Ndo it well guess it could
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,be because I ate the berry\Nberry fruit barrier crash
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the fighting king elizabello is out of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the running that means block b's winner is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that that's out of the way,\Nthe rest of you can go to hell too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, buzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner was that weird chicken, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame flame fruit's mine,\Nand soon I can give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You are your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody could hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me you want\Nto destroy the Smile Factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My comrades and I have been making\Npreparations to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tear that factory down in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:21:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, then it'll be too late for\Nus to rescue all of the factory workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a risky mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of this country depends\Non whether or not we succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, if you truly have enough\Ncourage to stand against Doflamingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,then first let me tell you\Nthe sad history of Dressrosa.
